e": "engenn4le01ob05re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Head north on Rue de Rivoli toward the Passage Richelieu entrance.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sounds complicated! <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Take the yellow line.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Where is the nearest station?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Walk straight ahead to the gallery. The station is opposite it. Go down the stairs. The underground path takes you straight to line 1.<br>", "time": "15400", "id": 3}, {"image": "engenn4le01ob05re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Which direction?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Take the westbound train. The platform is in front of the ticket booth. Get off at Charles de Gaulle - \u00c9toile station.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Where do I go from there?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Turn right when you get off. Walk to the end of the pathway and follow the signs.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Thanks!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Stranger</span>: Not a problem! Enjoy the city lights!<br>", "time": "36800", "id": 4}]}}], "id": 1}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"content": "It's Time to Travel", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "The City of Lights", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 5, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Out and About in the City > Paris", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 1, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about directions to places in  a limited range of social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Asking For and Giving Directions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you ask for directions, use <span class=\"strong\"> wh- </span>words.  <br>When you give directions, use Imperatives, expressions and prepositions of place.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Directions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Giving Directions\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">How do I get to \u2026 ?</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where is ... ? </span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Where is the nearest* \u2026 ?</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">What stop do I get off ... ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Go straight ahead.</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Turn left/right.</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Head north/south/east/ west on \u2026</span> <br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">opposite</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">near</span><br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">next to </span> <br> <span class=\\\"italic\\\">in front of</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">*nearest = located a short distance away</span> ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: Where is the nearest station?       <br>      <span class=\"strong\">Allen</span>: Head west on Main Street. The station is opposite the bakery. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">John</span>: How do I get to the Arc De Triomphe by bus? <br/>    <span class=\"strong\">Allen</span>:  Go straight ahead to that bus stop. Take the # 95 bus north and get off at \u00c9toile.", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "north ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the direction that is at the top of a map", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Head north on this street.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to give directions in a city. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "toward", "type": "name"}, {"content": "in the direction of", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(preposition)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Walk toward the building.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "entrance", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a space that you go through to enter a place", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Go down the stairs of the entrance. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "complicated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "difficult to understand", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That sounds complicated. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "underground path", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a track that you can walk on under the ground ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The underground path takes you there.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "ticket booth ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the place where you can buy tickets ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The platform is in front of the ticket booth.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "westbound", "type": "name"}, {"content": "travelling towards the west", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Take the westbound train.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "pathway ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a path a person can walk along", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Walk to the end of the pathway.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le01ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue (5-7 lines).", "type": "text"}, {"content": "There is a tourist in your city. They are lost and need directions to a place. They ask you.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Give them directions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Practice your dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Switch roles.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I ask and give directions.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use prepositions of place.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I practice with a partner. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I switch roles.", "type": "text"}]}]}